login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165519872,"discussion_id":"fbed4c467bee33c9aa77093dafb8367db7c2f158","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-17T16:45:49+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T16:45:49+08:00","user":{"id":"65e332861a2fdd033d9d2496","login":"SimpleBright_Man","object_id":"65e332861a2fdd033d9d2496","name":"Simple_Bright&Man","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/ba/fc47b0ab295fc742c588a5d7a4a80205294ff6e47d8678fb2e89039c5ef9ba35.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/SimpleBright_Man"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165519960,"discussion_id":"3a8bd008506f38424211179d0c699187c259cba9","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复了All-to-All矩阵乘法算子在SmoothQuant或分段量化场景下，局部张量内存地址计算错误的问题。原错误逻辑可能导致后续数据拷贝或计算访问到错误的UB内存区域，从而引发数据损坏或计算错误。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n统一修改了`QuantToken`和`QuantTokenSegment`函数中第二个乒乓缓冲张量`copyTensor1`的初始化方式。将原先基于不同基地址（如`smoothScaleTensor`）的偏移计算，改为统一从第一个张量`copyTensor0`的地址进行连续偏移，确保了UB内存布局的正确性和连续性，消除了潜在的数组越界和缓冲区溢出风险。","created_at":"2026-03-17T16:46:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T16:46:21+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165520044,"discussion_id":"6430336089f4db1575fa77131efd1cc69a4f92b3","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=1d49c8a84976476d925c125323687519&projectName=CANN'>1d49c8a84976476d925c125323687519</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导